WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.301 --> 00:00:01.724
- [Voiceover] So many people have

00:00:01.724 --> 00:00:04.619
a preconceived notion
of what I am capable of

00:00:04.619 --> 00:00:05.861
just at first sight.

00:00:05.861 --> 00:00:09.441
When I do my thing and they see it

00:00:09.441 --> 00:00:11.392
and they're like whoa.

00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:14.059
(hip hop music)

00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:20.774
I love giving that shock and ah feeling.

00:00:20.774 --> 00:00:24.010
It's just like, so you
think I can only do this

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:27.891
but I'm going to show you
I can do so much more.

00:00:27.891 --> 00:00:29.640
My name is Dexter Mayfield

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.825
and I am a plus-size male
model and professional dancer

00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:35.736
for about eight years now, oh my goodness.

00:00:35.736 --> 00:00:38.426
The journey has been long.

00:00:38.426 --> 00:00:42.410
It has been hard being a bigger person.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:45.019
There's not as many opportunities

00:00:45.019 --> 00:00:48.077
but at the same time there's
so many opportunities

00:00:48.077 --> 00:00:49.899
that you would never expect.

00:00:49.899 --> 00:00:51.861
I am so happy with this.

00:00:51.861 --> 00:00:53.754
So I've been able to
dance for Jennifer Lopez

00:00:53.754 --> 00:00:55.540
for her “Papi” music video,

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:58.506
Sara Bareilles for her “Brave” music video.

00:00:58.506 --> 00:01:00.845
I was actually able to walk the runway

00:01:00.845 --> 00:01:05.616
as a plus-size model for Marco
Marco at L.A. Fashion Week

00:01:05.616 --> 00:01:09.783
and that has been an eye
opening experience for me.

00:01:12.871 --> 00:01:15.694
I was never actually trained

00:01:15.694 --> 00:01:17.080
professionally as a dancer.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:20.234
I never expected to be
a professional dancer

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:21.817
given my body type.

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:26.136
Being a gay black man
in America is not easy,

00:01:26.136 --> 00:01:29.564
especially being a big
gay black man in America,

00:01:29.564 --> 00:01:31.992
and it took me awhile to really

00:01:31.992 --> 00:01:35.782
find that love for myself, my true self.

00:01:35.782 --> 00:01:37.822
Whenever we think of bigger men

00:01:37.822 --> 00:01:42.393
we view them as something to
laugh at and we're not that.

00:01:42.393 --> 00:01:46.693
We love our bodies as
well and we are sexy too.

00:01:46.693 --> 00:01:50.860
Like, I can't say that
enough, like, we are sexy too.

00:01:51.753 --> 00:01:52.901
At the end of the day,

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:54.818
I just wanna be seen as

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:57.657
someone who

00:01:58.635 --> 00:01:59.476
deserves this,

00:01:59.476 --> 00:02:01.419
as someone who is capable,

00:02:01.419 --> 00:02:03.555
not just seen as just
an overweight person,

00:02:03.555 --> 00:02:06.681
not just seen as a black actor, dancer,

00:02:06.681 --> 00:02:11.292
not seen as whatever
that first impression is.

00:02:11.292 --> 00:02:14.769
I just wanna be seen as
someone who is talented enough

00:02:14.769 --> 00:02:15.824
for this job.

00:02:15.824 --> 00:02:18.657
(inspiring music)

